4 Requirements 

4.1 Functional requirements 

LOGIN-FR-01 – Existing Login Functionality 
The existing login functionality must not be altered or changed during the re-styling process of the login process 

Acceptance Criteria: 

Existing authentication behaviour must remain unchanged after restyling. 

 

